 "applies_to": "YORK YVWA water-cooled variable-speed screw chillers (microboards 031-02478 / 031-03478), connected through a YORK E-Link gateway over YorkTalk 2.",
 "summary": "Before the SC-EQ card, YVWA chillers reached a BAS through the E-Link gateway, which reads the microboard over YorkTalk 2 (4800 baud) and serves BACnet, N2, LON and Modbus objects named by YorkTalk page. Section 1 holds remote commands and core chiller data; section 2 holds further system and option points.",
 "bacnet_transport": [],
 "firmware": null,
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": false,
 "notes": [
  "This is a YorkTalk 2 E-Link sheet; objects are named by YorkTalk page (YT2_S01_P03 and so on), and only populated slots not marked unavailable on every version are listed.",
  "Access follows the sheet's Modbus function note: the remote slots AV 1-4 and BV 1-4 accept writes; the rest are read-only.",
  "Multistate states are shown as printed (from 0); this sheet does not say whether the BACnet value adds 1, so confirm by discovery (read the state text)."
 ],
